{
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "text": "Resilience is built one connection at a time."
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "text": "In coastal communities where winter storms grow sharper, power is secured not by promises, but by infrastructure."
    },
    {
      "id": "b3",
      "text": "This is how Helios Bay transformed its grid from the coastline inward."
    },
    {
      "id": "b4",
      "text": "At dawn, Helios Bay reveals the machinery of its clean energy transition."
    },
    {
      "id": "b5",
      "text": "A working harbour stands beside offshore wind turbines and rooftop solar arrays."
    },
    {
      "id": "b6",
      "text": "For decades, the city relied on imported fossil fuels vulnerable to severe gales."
    },
    {
      "id": "b7",
      "text": "At the centre is Maya Sen, the fictional grid coordinator responsible for storm resilience."
    },
    {
      "id": "b8",
      "text": "Her role demands balancing variable renewable power with neighborhood demand during surges."
    },
    {
      "id": "b9",
      "text": "Under pressure, Maya made the decisive call to decentralise control and add local storage."
    },
    {
      "id": "b10",
      "text": "The programme moved through four structured milestones."
    },
    {
      "id": "b11",
      "text": "A grid audit on February 12th, 2027 was followed by the harbour battery opening on June 3rd, 2028."
    },
    {
      "id": "b12",
      "text": "Three microgrids connected on September 18th, 2029, and the diesel reserve retired on December 1st, 2030."
    },
    {
      "id": "b13",
      "text": "With every milestone, clean generation expanded across the network."
    },
    {
      "id": "b14",
      "text": "Renewable electricity rose from 24 percent in 2027 to 39 percent in 2028."
    },
    {
      "id": "b15",
      "text": "It reached 55 percent in 2029, before hitting 72 percent in 2030."
    },
    {
      "id": "b16",
      "text": "Reliability gains soon registered across every district."
    },
    {
      "id": "b17",
      "text": "Following the rollout, annual outage minutes fell steadily."
    },
    {
      "id": "b18",
      "text": "Harbour Ward recorded 42 outage minutes, East Bank reached 27, and Hillside dropped to 16."
    },
    {
      "id": "b19",
      "text": "By 2030, the transition reached its central milestone."
    },
    {
      "id": "b20",
      "text": "Seventy-two percent stands as the single headline statistic defining the clean energy share."
    },
    {
      "id": "b21",
      "text": "The human value proved clearest during severe weather."
    },
    {
      "id": "b22",
      "text": "Night-shift nurse Samira Vale recalled working through a major coastal storm."
    },
    {
      "id": "b23",
      "text": "She observed: The lights stayed on when the storm crossed the bay."
    },
    {
      "id": "b24",
      "text": "The programme did not eliminate risk; it shortened outages and gave essential workers a more dependable city."
    }
  ],
